# Linden, the Steadfast Queen (3/3 vigilance): "Whenever a white creature you control attacks, you gain 1 life." (CR 508.1m, 603.2.)
# Bot1 pays exactly {W}{W}{W} with Black Lotus, then Elite Vanguard ({W}, white) and Memnite (colorless). On turn 3 all three
# attack: Linden herself and the Vanguard are white creatures Bot1 controls, so 2 life (20 -> 22), not 3 for the colorless
# Memnite. Linden's vigilance keeps her untapped. On turn 4 Bot2's own white Elite Vanguard attacks: Bot1 gains nothing.

